A sale and purchase does not produce a sale price warning.

========== API ==========

accounts({})

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Holdings
account Bank
account Result
account Fees
account Other
P 2024-01-01 FUND 100 USD
2024-01-01 Purchase
  Holdings  10 FUND {100 USD}
  Bank  -1000 USD
2024-01-02 Sale
  Holdings  -2 FUND {100 USD} @ 120 USD
  Holdings  1 FUND {110 USD}
  Bank  130 USD
  Result  -40 USD

